1
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,880
<font color="#ffffff">Don't tell me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

2
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:45,080
<font color="#ffffff">you want me to stage a diamond heist</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

3
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,480
<font color="#ffffff">for the insurance money.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

4
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,160
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:52,080
<font color="#ffffff">Are you really risking all this</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to help Yok get the insurance money?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

6
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:53,960
<font color="#ffffff">Do you think I'm stupid?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:58,320
<font color="#ffffff">I'm keeping the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

8
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:01,640
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

9
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:05,120
<font color="#ffffff">What does Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">have to do with this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

10
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:06,800
<font color="#ffffff">Do you remember Sergeant Padej?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

11
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:10,120
<font color="#ffffff">He's the man you put behind bars</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">six years ago.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

12
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,240
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej of back then…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

13
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,720
<font color="#ffffff">is Luang Pho Suea of today.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

14
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:19,960
<font color="#ffffff">You're the reason for all my troubles!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

15
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:22,080
<font color="#ffffff">You can't just pin this all on me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

16
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:25,000
<font color="#ffffff">It's your fault too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

17
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:28,200
<font color="#ffffff">If you hadn't sent Lek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to steal the diamond,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

18
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,600
<font color="#ffffff">they would never have found out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

19
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,440
<font color="#ffffff">Hey! Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

20
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,920
<font color="#ffffff">Where have you been?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

21
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:39,040
<font color="#ffffff">You've had us all looking for you.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">We thought you got captured!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

22
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">It's good that he's back, at least.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

23
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,840
<font color="#ffffff">All right, let's pack up.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Our ride is almost here.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

24
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,160
<font color="#ffffff">Here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

25
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,160
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

26
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,560
<font color="#ffffff">Let me help.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

27
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,960
<font color="#ffffff">No need, I've got it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

28
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:21,320
<font color="#ffffff">-Is everything ready?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, Luang Pho.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

29
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:24,000
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you very much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

30
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,720
<font color="#ffffff">May you have longevity,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">beauty, joy, and strength.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

31
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:28,840
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Sadhu.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

32
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:32,000
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much for your help, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

33
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:34,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'll stick to the backroads</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

34
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">to avoid checkpoints.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

35
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:38,920
<font color="#ffffff">If I see anything unusual,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'll call you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">Please get in, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

38
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,080
<font color="#ffffff">Be careful.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

39
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,280
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:55,080
<font color="#ffffff">Thanks again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

41
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:47,960
<font color="#ffffff">Wow! Luang Pho, are you taking me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">on a trip to Bangkok?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

42
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:58,720
<font color="#ffffff">Is the junior disciple sick?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

43
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:01,880
<font color="#ffffff">Why is he unusually quiet?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Not a peep out of him.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

44
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,280
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you very much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

45
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's move, Sergeant.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Move where, sir?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

46
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,480
<font color="#ffffff">I know where Ya is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

47
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,680
<font color="#ffffff">Going to see the reporter? Why?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

48
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,200
<font color="#ffffff">Just come along. You'll see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

49
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:28,960
<font color="#ffffff">Let's hope it's not</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">what I think it is. Move!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

50
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,600
<font color="#ffffff">Hello?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

51
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:11,240
<font color="#ffffff"><i>We're officially out of the city now.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

52
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:12,920
<font color="#ffffff">Got it. Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,880
<font color="#ffffff">We've officially left Mae Hong Son.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:21,600
<font color="#ffffff">We should be safe now, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

55
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:38,000
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, pull over! I said pull over!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,000
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

57
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">What's going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

58
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:44,040
<font color="#ffffff">Pull over, or I'll shoot!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

59
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,720
<font color="#ffffff">Who is it this time?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I thought we were safe!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

60
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:07,120
<font color="#ffffff">-Gosh!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Who's that?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

61
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,440
<font color="#ffffff">Ouch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

62
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:49,680
<font color="#ffffff">That hurts.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

63
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:54,200
<font color="#ffffff">Get down!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

64
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,240
<font color="#ffffff">Get down now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

65
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:59,280
<font color="#ffffff">Open the back doors!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

66
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,320
<font color="#ffffff">We're being ambushed!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

67
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,320
<font color="#ffffff">What do we do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

68
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,640
<font color="#ffffff">Open the doors!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:12,440
<font color="#ffffff">Faster!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

70
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,320
<font color="#ffffff">Hurry up!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

71
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,840
<font color="#ffffff">All of you, get down!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

72
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,520
<font color="#ffffff">You too, monk!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,480
<font color="#ffffff">Out now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

74
00:09:30,560 --> 00:09:32,360
<font color="#ffffff">Take it easy, man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

75
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,680
<font color="#ffffff">Just stay calm.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

76
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:35,120
<font color="#ffffff">Move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

77
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,760
<font color="#ffffff">A monk has nothing to do with this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

78
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:44,000
<font color="#ffffff">Out! Get down now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

79
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:45,840
<font color="#ffffff">The women too!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

80
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:48,040
<font color="#ffffff">Easy, easy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

81
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:50,800
<font color="#ffffff">Hurry up!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

82
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:53,000
<font color="#ffffff">-Stop stalling!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Easy. Hold on!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

83
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,240
<font color="#ffffff">Calm down first.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,600
<font color="#ffffff">-Just calm down.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

85
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:02,440
<font color="#ffffff">Hey! Grab them all!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

86
00:10:02,520 --> 00:10:04,200
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, wait!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

87
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:05,520
<font color="#ffffff">What do you want?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

88
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:08,760
<font color="#ffffff">Take me alone and let them go. Please.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

89
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:11,080
<font color="#ffffff">Everyone!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

90
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:12,760
<font color="#ffffff">Listen to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

91
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:15,360
<font color="#ffffff">If you are here to take Boonrod,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

92
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:17,040
<font color="#ffffff">take me instead.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

93
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:19,280
<font color="#ffffff">-Trust me on this.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Luang Pho, no!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

94
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">In that case, hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

95
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,200
<font color="#ffffff">Take all of them!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

96
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:35,720
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho, run!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,400
<font color="#ffffff">-Are you okay?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Boonrod.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

98
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,160
<font color="#ffffff">That was a close one.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

99
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,600
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Okay.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

100
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,040
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Watch out!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

101
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:40,160
<font color="#ffffff">Move, Luang Pho, move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

102
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:48,800
<font color="#ffffff">Whoa!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

103
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:05,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'm out of ammo!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

104
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:08,480
<font color="#ffffff">What do we do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

105
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:11,120
<font color="#ffffff">Keep running! We can't stop.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

106
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:13,200
<font color="#ffffff">This way!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

107
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:14,120
<font color="#ffffff">Gosh.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

108
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:18,120
<font color="#ffffff">-What now?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-I don't think we can keep going.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

109
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,680
<font color="#ffffff">We're surrounded.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

110
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,760
<font color="#ffffff">I think</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

111
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">another group is shooting at us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,760
<font color="#ffffff">Who are they, Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,080
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, they're all retreating.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

114
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's over.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

115
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:03,040
<font color="#ffffff">We were sent to help you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">Captain,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

117
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,760
<font color="#ffffff">this is very strange.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

118
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:16,920
<font color="#ffffff">None of Ya's friends</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">seem to know where she went.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

119
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,600
<font color="#ffffff">Exactly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

120
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:20,040
<font color="#ffffff">She just vanished.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

121
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:24,200
<font color="#ffffff">Everything's been suspicious</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">since she rented the van<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

122
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:28,160
<font color="#ffffff">and checked in at that hotel.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

123
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:34,200
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah. Let's go, hurry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

124
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:57,160
<font color="#ffffff">Who sent you to help us?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

125
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:01,400
<font color="#ffffff">And why did you bring us here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

126
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,160
<font color="#ffffff">You?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

127
00:14:27,400 --> 00:14:28,400
<font color="#ffffff">You know her?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

128
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not sure, but she looks familiar.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

129
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:36,040
<font color="#ffffff">Welcome, everyone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

130
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:38,200
<font color="#ffffff">I am Darat, the owner of this house.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

131
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:48,720
<font color="#ffffff">Respects to you, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

132
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,920
<font color="#ffffff">Bless you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

133
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:55,200
<font color="#ffffff">I was the one who sent my men</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to rescue you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

134
00:14:58,640 --> 00:14:59,640
<font color="#ffffff">Chan,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

135
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:02,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'm glad you made it back safely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

136
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,840
<font color="#ffffff">Do we know each other?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

137
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:12,720
<font color="#ffffff">It seems the rumors about your memory loss</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

138
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,280
<font color="#ffffff">are true.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:21,120
<font color="#ffffff">We don't just know each other.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

140
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm your girlfriend.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

141
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:24,560
<font color="#ffffff">Girlfriend?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

142
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:25,600
<font color="#ffffff">Girlfriend?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

143
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:39,800
<font color="#ffffff">My girlfriend?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

144
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,200
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

145
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

146
00:15:58,800 --> 00:16:01,120
<font color="#ffffff">Has it been very difficult</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for you all this time?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

147
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:06,160
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:11,240
<font color="#ffffff">Since when did he secretly</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">find a girlfriend?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

149
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:14,040
<font color="#ffffff">I feel so bad for Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,480
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

151
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:19,520
<font color="#ffffff">That's adult business.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

152
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:23,080
<font color="#ffffff">Were you speaking to me, Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

153
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:28,160
<font color="#ffffff">Not at all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

154
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:37,520
<font color="#ffffff">But isn't it weird</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

155
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:42,040
<font color="#ffffff">that Chansuek's girlfriend came</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to rescue us out of nowhere?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

156
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:54,360
<font color="#ffffff">I've had people searching for you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">ever since you went missing,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

157
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,560
<font color="#ffffff">but they found nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

158
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:59,360
<font color="#ffffff">When I heard the news</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">about you and Luang Pho,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

159
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:02,360
<font color="#ffffff">I saw an opportunity to help.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

160
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,359
<font color="#ffffff">I see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:07,200
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

162
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:09,880
<font color="#ffffff">If you say we are together,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

163
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:12,240
<font color="#ffffff">could you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

164
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:16,000
<font color="#ffffff">help me remember our past?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

165
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,200
<font color="#ffffff">Reporting for duty.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

166
00:17:35,760 --> 00:17:37,440
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

167
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:40,920
<font color="#ffffff">Did you summon me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

168
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:45,160
<font color="#ffffff">I want to introduce you two.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:48,280
<font color="#ffffff">This is Darat, the owner of the resort</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in Mae Hong Son.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

171
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:57,560
<font color="#ffffff">She will be helping you infiltrate</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng's operations.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

172
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,040
<font color="#ffffff">Pleasure to meet you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

173
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:05,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

174
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,640
<font color="#ffffff">Pleasure to meet you too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

175
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:19,040
<font color="#ffffff">If you run into any trouble,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you can contact me anytime.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

176
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:21,400
<font color="#ffffff">Or just come to my resort.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

177
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:23,520
<font color="#ffffff">I'm ready to help you with anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

178
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:25,680
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you very much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

179
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:28,440
<font color="#ffffff">I don't want to trouble you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">if I can help it.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

180
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,640
<font color="#ffffff">It's no trouble at all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

181
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:32,720
<font color="#ffffff">I really want to help.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

182
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:53,280
<font color="#ffffff">You were sent to investigate</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the diamond undercover,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

183
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:57,560
<font color="#ffffff">so I helped get you a job</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">inside Kamnan Sawaeng's gang.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

184
00:18:58,560 --> 00:18:59,400
<font color="#ffffff">I see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

185
00:19:00,280 --> 00:19:01,200
<font color="#ffffff">That's how it was.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

186
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:04,880
<font color="#ffffff">It was not for very long,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

187
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:07,000
<font color="#ffffff">but we helped each other,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

188
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:08,680
<font color="#ffffff">grew close,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

189
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:11,200
<font color="#ffffff">and decided to date.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

190
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:26,080
<font color="#ffffff">Chan!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

191
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:27,760
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

192
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,720
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

193
00:19:32,080 --> 00:19:33,360
<font color="#ffffff">My…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

194
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:35,160
<font color="#ffffff">My head hurts.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

195
00:19:35,760 --> 00:19:37,040
<font color="#ffffff">Ouch…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

196
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:00,200
<font color="#ffffff">Have a seat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

197
00:20:01,280 --> 00:20:02,280
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

198
00:20:17,120 --> 00:20:19,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so happy you're back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

199
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:24,360
<font color="#ffffff">I was so worried,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">waiting for you every day.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

200
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:28,760
<font color="#ffffff">I thought I'd never see you again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

201
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,520
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

202
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:33,520
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

203
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:36,080
<font color="#ffffff">that I can't remember anything about us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

204
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'm really sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

205
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:44,400
<font color="#ffffff">It's all right. I understand.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

206
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">Just having you back safe and sound</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is more than enough.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

207
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:51,720
<font color="#ffffff">As for the rest,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

208
00:20:51,800 --> 00:20:54,640
<font color="#ffffff">we can work on rebuilding</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">your memories together.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

209
00:20:57,840 --> 00:20:59,040
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

210
00:21:00,560 --> 00:21:02,400
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

211
00:21:03,080 --> 00:21:05,160
<font color="#ffffff">From now on,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

212
00:21:05,760 --> 00:21:08,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'll do everything I can</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to help you and Luang Pho Suea.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

213
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:15,680
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you very much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

214
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:44,080
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

215
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:45,160
<font color="#ffffff">No! Don't!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

216
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,800
<font color="#ffffff">You idiot!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

217
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:55,280
<font color="#ffffff">You!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

218
00:21:55,800 --> 00:21:57,080
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you kiss me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

219
00:21:57,160 --> 00:21:58,440
<font color="#ffffff">You did that!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

220
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:01,880
<font color="#ffffff">It's you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

221
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,800
<font color="#ffffff">Are you here to rescue me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

222
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:05,000
<font color="#ffffff">Let's get out of here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

223
00:22:11,480 --> 00:22:13,120
<font color="#ffffff">Grab them!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

224
00:22:18,120 --> 00:22:19,760
<font color="#ffffff">Hold on, sir!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

225
00:22:19,840 --> 00:22:20,880
<font color="#ffffff">Officers! I'm Thai!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

226
00:22:20,960 --> 00:22:22,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm Thai too, sir!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

227
00:22:22,760 --> 00:22:25,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'm Thai! We made it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

228
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:33,080
<font color="#ffffff">Oops!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

229
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:35,920
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's move.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Again?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

230
00:22:38,600 --> 00:22:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">-Ouch.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

231
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:42,560
<font color="#ffffff">I don't think you can walk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

232
00:22:43,760 --> 00:22:45,000
<font color="#ffffff">Get on my back,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

233
00:22:45,080 --> 00:22:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">or it'll just get worse.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

234
00:23:03,840 --> 00:23:05,440
<font color="#ffffff">But I don't have a single memory</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

235
00:23:05,520 --> 00:23:07,040
<font color="#ffffff">left in my head.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

236
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">Right now, I have two fond memories.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

237
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:13,960
<font color="#ffffff">What are they?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

238
00:23:15,280 --> 00:23:18,120
<font color="#ffffff">One is of Luang Pho Suea…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

239
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,160
<font color="#ffffff">The other</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

240
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:23,560
<font color="#ffffff">is of you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

241
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:38,360
<font color="#ffffff">The only people who matter in my life</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

242
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">are Luang Pho…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

243
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:42,440
<font color="#ffffff">and you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

244
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:45,080
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you realize</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

245
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:48,560
<font color="#ffffff">that you're just as important to me too?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

246
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,240
<font color="#ffffff">Do we know each other?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

247
00:23:55,320 --> 00:23:57,880
<font color="#ffffff">We don't just know each other.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

248
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:01,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm your girlfriend.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

249
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:03,320
<font color="#ffffff">Chan!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

250
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:04,920
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

251
00:24:16,320 --> 00:24:18,600
<font color="#ffffff"><i>There really is</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>nothing certain in this life,</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

252
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:20,880
<font color="#ffffff"><i>just like Luang Pho said.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

253
00:24:21,560 --> 00:24:23,040
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Just let him go.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

254
00:24:23,120 --> 00:24:25,920
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Even if Ms. Darat hadn't shown up,</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

255
00:24:26,000 --> 00:24:28,480
<font color="#ffffff"><i>we still would not have worked out.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

256
00:24:29,560 --> 00:24:32,200
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Don't forget your duty, Noona.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

257
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:33,960
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Don't forget.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

258
00:24:58,920 --> 00:25:01,720
<font color="#ffffff">So, what's the plan now, Chan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

259
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:16,560
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, I see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

260
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">I mean, if I can help in any way,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">please let me know.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

261
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:23,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm ready to support you all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

262
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:25,440
<font color="#ffffff">Before we get to that,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

263
00:25:25,520 --> 00:25:28,880
<font color="#ffffff">could you tell us how you knew about us?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

264
00:25:29,560 --> 00:25:30,800
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

265
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:33,600
<font color="#ffffff">How did you know to rescue us</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">from those thugs?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

266
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:37,120
<font color="#ffffff">Those men work for Paul.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

267
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:45,440
<font color="#ffffff">You're probably wondering how I know this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

268
00:25:45,520 --> 00:25:47,800
<font color="#ffffff">It's because I work for him too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

269
00:25:57,960 --> 00:26:01,200
<font color="#ffffff">That's how I know everything about you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

270
00:26:05,640 --> 00:26:07,280
<font color="#ffffff">But don't worry,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

271
00:26:07,360 --> 00:26:11,120
<font color="#ffffff">Paul has no idea I helped you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

272
00:26:13,160 --> 00:26:15,200
<font color="#ffffff">My dad owes a debt to Paul's casino,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

273
00:26:15,840 --> 00:26:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">and our family resort was seized.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

274
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:21,360
<font color="#ffffff">I was forced to work for him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

275
00:26:22,000 --> 00:26:23,800
<font color="#ffffff">How can we believe a word you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

276
00:26:26,280 --> 00:26:28,000
<font color="#ffffff">You don't have to.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

277
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:31,160
<font color="#ffffff">I only want to protect the man I love.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

278
00:26:40,040 --> 00:26:41,920
<font color="#ffffff">Okay. Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

279
00:26:42,600 --> 00:26:44,800
<font color="#ffffff">Either way, Ms. Darat</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

280
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:48,080
<font color="#ffffff">did rescue us</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

281
00:26:48,160 --> 00:26:50,120
<font color="#ffffff">and give us a place to stay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

282
00:26:50,840 --> 00:26:52,920
<font color="#ffffff">May you be blessed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

283
00:26:53,600 --> 00:26:56,400
<font color="#ffffff">Actually, I want to do much more.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

284
00:26:57,360 --> 00:27:00,240
<font color="#ffffff">I want to clear Chan's name</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">from this diamond theft<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

285
00:27:00,320 --> 00:27:03,320
<font color="#ffffff">so he can return</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to being a police officer.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

286
00:27:04,040 --> 00:27:07,080
<font color="#ffffff">If anyone needs anything, just tell me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

287
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:09,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm ready.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

288
00:27:35,080 --> 00:27:36,680
<font color="#ffffff">Hello, boss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

289
00:27:40,560 --> 00:27:41,680
<font color="#ffffff">What's the situation?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

290
00:27:41,760 --> 00:27:43,160
<font color="#ffffff">From what I can see,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

291
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:45,680
<font color="#ffffff">Chan still doesn't believe</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">what you told him.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

292
00:27:45,760 --> 00:27:47,640
<font color="#ffffff">He still trusts Luang Pho completely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

293
00:27:48,680 --> 00:27:53,040
<font color="#ffffff">I can't believe a monk managed</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to sway someone like Chansuek.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

294
00:27:53,840 --> 00:27:56,840
<font color="#ffffff">More importantly, Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is currently arranging<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

295
00:27:56,920 --> 00:28:00,440
<font color="#ffffff"><i>for Chan to turn himself in</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>to a higher-up he knows.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

296
00:28:01,280 --> 00:28:02,680
<font color="#ffffff">Do you know who it is?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

297
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">Go find out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

298
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:07,400
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

299
00:28:26,440 --> 00:28:28,320
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek lied to you, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

300
00:28:29,160 --> 00:28:30,760
<font color="#ffffff">They are fleeing right now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

301
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:31,960
<font color="#ffffff">What should we do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

302
00:28:32,680 --> 00:28:34,160
<font color="#ffffff">Should I have Wayu</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

303
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:35,840
<font color="#ffffff">capture them all?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

304
00:28:48,600 --> 00:28:49,840
<font color="#ffffff">Give me a moment.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

305
00:28:58,840 --> 00:29:00,880
<font color="#ffffff">What do you think you're doing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

306
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,000
<font color="#ffffff">Eavesdropping?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

307
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:06,560
<font color="#ffffff">Ouch! That hurts!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

308
00:29:07,080 --> 00:29:08,920
<font color="#ffffff">Do you care about Chansuek that much?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

309
00:29:09,520 --> 00:29:12,040
<font color="#ffffff">Do you love him</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and want to help him so badly?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

310
00:29:12,120 --> 00:29:13,880
<font color="#ffffff">Let me go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

311
00:29:13,960 --> 00:29:15,000
<font color="#ffffff">I won't.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

312
00:29:15,080 --> 00:29:15,920
<font color="#ffffff">-Stop!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-It hurts!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

313
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:17,920
<font color="#ffffff">That's enough.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

314
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:35,360
<font color="#ffffff">Does Darat have feelings for Chansuek?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

315
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,160
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, boss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

316
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:39,080
<font color="#ffffff">Ever since you brought him in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

317
00:29:59,560 --> 00:30:02,960
<font color="#ffffff">Boss, I promise</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I won't contact Chan ever again.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

318
00:30:03,040 --> 00:30:04,960
<font color="#ffffff">Please don't hurt me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

319
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:07,000
<font color="#ffffff">Bring him in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

320
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:11,200
<font color="#ffffff">Dad!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

321
00:30:11,280 --> 00:30:14,040
<font color="#ffffff">-Move!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Let me go!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

322
00:30:14,120 --> 00:30:16,520
<font color="#ffffff">-Ouch!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Dad!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

323
00:30:16,600 --> 00:30:18,080
<font color="#ffffff">Darat!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

324
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:20,360
<font color="#ffffff">Help me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

325
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:35,400
<font color="#ffffff">-Boss, please don't hurt him.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Darat!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

326
00:30:35,480 --> 00:30:37,080
<font color="#ffffff">He has nothing to do with this!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

327
00:30:50,360 --> 00:30:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">I beg you,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

328
00:30:52,080 --> 00:30:54,480
<font color="#ffffff">please don't hurt him!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

329
00:30:55,440 --> 00:30:56,760
<font color="#ffffff">Dad!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

330
00:30:57,680 --> 00:30:59,680
<font color="#ffffff">Now you know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

331
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:02,320
<font color="#ffffff">your life</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

332
00:31:02,920 --> 00:31:04,000
<font color="#ffffff">is in my hands.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

333
00:31:05,360 --> 00:31:07,120
<font color="#ffffff">Whatever you want me to do,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

334
00:31:07,200 --> 00:31:10,480
<font color="#ffffff">just say it. I'll do anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

335
00:31:11,080 --> 00:31:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">Please just let him go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

336
00:31:23,560 --> 00:31:25,000
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

337
00:31:25,080 --> 00:31:26,120
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

338
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:28,800
<font color="#ffffff">So is that the place?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

339
00:31:29,520 --> 00:31:30,600
<font color="#ffffff">Okay. All right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

340
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:33,560
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you very much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

341
00:31:34,600 --> 00:31:35,720
<font color="#ffffff">Bless you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:31:39,680 --> 00:31:42,000
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod, good news.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:31:43,040 --> 00:31:45,960
<font color="#ffffff">Commander Chayanon has agreed to help you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

344
00:31:47,560 --> 00:31:48,440
<font color="#ffffff">Got it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:14,920
<font color="#ffffff">If I talk to her out of the blue…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

346
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:16,480
<font color="#ffffff">won't it be a bit weird?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

347
00:32:19,080 --> 00:32:20,520
<font color="#ffffff">But shouldn't I</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

348
00:32:20,600 --> 00:32:23,280
<font color="#ffffff">clear things up with her, Boonrod?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:34,080
<font color="#ffffff">What if she asks</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

350
00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">who I am to tell her this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:32:40,400 --> 00:32:41,560
<font color="#ffffff">Whatever!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

352
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">Come on!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

353
00:32:47,320 --> 00:32:49,080
<font color="#ffffff">You scared me to death.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

354
00:32:51,200 --> 00:32:52,440
<font color="#ffffff">Why?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

355
00:32:53,080 --> 00:32:55,360
<font color="#ffffff">Do I need your permission before leaving?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

356
00:32:56,000 --> 00:32:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

357
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:03,520
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you going?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

358
00:33:04,840 --> 00:33:07,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going home.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

359
00:33:09,720 --> 00:33:10,800
<font color="#ffffff">Right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

360
00:33:11,560 --> 00:33:12,800
<font color="#ffffff">Now that we're in Bangkok</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

361
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:15,040
<font color="#ffffff">and I'm turning myself in tomorrow,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

362
00:33:15,120 --> 00:33:16,640
<font color="#ffffff">it'll be over.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

363
00:33:16,720 --> 00:33:18,800
<font color="#ffffff">You can go back to your normal life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

364
00:33:22,080 --> 00:33:23,200
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

365
00:33:24,080 --> 00:33:25,080
<font color="#ffffff">Exactly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

366
00:33:27,640 --> 00:33:28,760
<font color="#ffffff">And you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

367
00:33:28,840 --> 00:33:30,640
<font color="#ffffff">don't really need me around anymore.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

368
00:33:47,120 --> 00:33:48,400
<font color="#ffffff">Are you leaving too?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

369
00:33:55,040 --> 00:33:56,040
<font color="#ffffff">It's not just me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

370
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:02,920
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

371
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:04,320
<font color="#ffffff">You're leaving too?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

372
00:34:04,400 --> 00:34:06,360
<font color="#ffffff">I am a monk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

373
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:10,280
<font color="#ffffff">Staying at a woman's house</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">isn't appropriate.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

374
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:13,480
<font color="#ffffff">Right. A monk belongs in a temple!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

375
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:16,520
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you going to stay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

376
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:26,080
<font color="#ffffff">How have you been?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

377
00:34:27,159 --> 00:34:28,239
<font color="#ffffff">How are you doing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

378
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:29,679
<font color="#ffffff">Long time no see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

379
00:34:29,760 --> 00:34:32,560
<font color="#ffffff">Did you miss me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

380
00:34:32,639 --> 00:34:35,639
<font color="#ffffff">You're looking well, as always.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

381
00:34:38,760 --> 00:34:41,480
<font color="#ffffff">I was ordained at this temple.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

382
00:34:41,560 --> 00:34:44,000
<font color="#ffffff">Whenever I'm in Bangkok,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

383
00:34:44,080 --> 00:34:46,520
<font color="#ffffff">I always stay here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

384
00:34:47,120 --> 00:34:50,400
<font color="#ffffff">You could have stayed at my house,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

385
00:34:50,480 --> 00:34:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">It's much more comfortable.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

386
00:34:52,679 --> 00:34:54,440
<font color="#ffffff">Oh no.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

387
00:34:55,239 --> 00:34:58,480
<font color="#ffffff">A monk shouldn't stay in a house.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

388
00:34:59,280 --> 00:35:01,480
<font color="#ffffff">If we do</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

389
00:35:01,560 --> 00:35:03,560
<font color="#ffffff">and cling to comfort,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

390
00:35:03,640 --> 00:35:05,440
<font color="#ffffff">there is no point in being ordained.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

391
00:35:05,520 --> 00:35:07,520
<font color="#ffffff">We might as well just sleep at home.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

392
00:35:08,200 --> 00:35:10,680
<font color="#ffffff">But if you stay at the temple,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

393
00:35:10,760 --> 00:35:12,400
<font color="#ffffff">Chan has to stay here too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

394
00:35:16,880 --> 00:35:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">Look.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

395
00:35:18,120 --> 00:35:19,480
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

396
00:35:19,560 --> 00:35:24,240
<font color="#ffffff">You can go stay</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">at Ms. Darat's house, okay?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

397
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:25,440
<font color="#ffffff">I don't mind.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

398
00:35:25,520 --> 00:35:27,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'd rather stay here with you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

399
00:35:27,920 --> 00:35:29,720
<font color="#ffffff">I want to discuss something with you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

400
00:35:29,800 --> 00:35:31,440
<font color="#ffffff">before I turn myself in tomorrow.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

401
00:35:32,640 --> 00:35:33,600
<font color="#ffffff">As you wish.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

402
00:35:36,760 --> 00:35:39,760
<font color="#ffffff">Well, if that's all,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'll take my leave now.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

403
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:40,960
<font color="#ffffff">Me too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

404
00:35:41,040 --> 00:35:42,120
<font color="#ffffff">Bless you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

405
00:35:42,200 --> 00:35:44,760
<font color="#ffffff">Safe travels.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

406
00:35:49,440 --> 00:35:51,520
<font color="#ffffff">I'll come pick you up tomorrow.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

407
00:35:53,840 --> 00:35:55,720
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

408
00:35:55,800 --> 00:35:56,800
<font color="#ffffff">Chan!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

409
00:35:59,840 --> 00:36:01,240
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

410
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:03,480
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

411
00:36:04,520 --> 00:36:06,560
<font color="#ffffff">If you want to talk, let's do it tomorrow.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

412
00:36:06,640 --> 00:36:07,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'm exhausted today.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

413
00:36:08,720 --> 00:36:09,600
<font color="#ffffff">Exactly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

414
00:36:09,680 --> 00:36:11,960
<font color="#ffffff">Let Noona and Ya go back and rest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

415
00:36:12,040 --> 00:36:14,000
<font color="#ffffff">They've had a very long day.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

416
00:36:15,520 --> 00:36:16,480
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

417
00:36:16,560 --> 00:36:17,920
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go, Ya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

418
00:36:45,880 --> 00:36:46,760
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

419
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:50,440
<font color="#ffffff">You can go stay at Ms. Darat's house.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

420
00:36:50,520 --> 00:36:52,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'd rather stay here with you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

421
00:36:52,840 --> 00:36:54,720
<font color="#ffffff">I want to talk to you about something</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

422
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:56,960
<font color="#ffffff">before I turn myself in tomorrow.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

423
00:36:57,040 --> 00:36:58,920
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

424
00:37:02,840 --> 00:37:03,840
<font color="#ffffff">Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

425
00:37:07,320 --> 00:37:08,600
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

426
00:37:08,680 --> 00:37:12,320
<font color="#ffffff">If you want to talk, let's do it tomorrow.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'm exhausted.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

427
00:37:40,200 --> 00:37:41,760
<font color="#ffffff">You look so tense.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

428
00:37:43,120 --> 00:37:44,480
<font color="#ffffff">Boss,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

429
00:37:44,560 --> 00:37:45,880
<font color="#ffffff">when did you all arrive?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

430
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:47,640
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you so startled?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

431
00:37:48,240 --> 00:37:49,840
<font color="#ffffff">Are you hiding something?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

432
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:53,160
<font color="#ffffff">No, of course not.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

433
00:37:53,240 --> 00:37:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">I just didn't expect you to come here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

434
00:37:57,880 --> 00:37:59,680
<font color="#ffffff">Isn't tomorrow an important day?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

435
00:38:01,080 --> 00:38:02,240
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

436
00:38:10,760 --> 00:38:12,360
<font color="#ffffff">Did I forget to lock the door?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

437
00:38:18,640 --> 00:38:20,280
<font color="#ffffff">And I left the lights on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

438
00:38:21,160 --> 00:38:22,320
<font color="#ffffff">How is that possible?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

439
00:38:25,520 --> 00:38:26,600
<font color="#ffffff">I knew it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

440
00:38:27,520 --> 00:38:28,840
<font color="#ffffff">I've been robbed!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

441
00:38:37,720 --> 00:38:39,000
<font color="#ffffff">You think you can rob me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

442
00:38:39,080 --> 00:38:40,280
<font color="#ffffff">It won't be that easy!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

443
00:38:46,240 --> 00:38:47,360
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

444
00:38:59,560 --> 00:39:01,920
<font color="#ffffff">Where on earth have you been?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

445
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:03,320
<font color="#ffffff">Do you know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

446
00:39:03,400 --> 00:39:06,600
<font color="#ffffff">I've been trying to contact you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">until my fingers went numb?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

447
00:39:06,680 --> 00:39:09,040
<font color="#ffffff">I had our entire northern network</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

448
00:39:09,120 --> 00:39:12,040
<font color="#ffffff">looking for you,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">but no one could find a trace.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

449
00:39:12,120 --> 00:39:13,840
<font color="#ffffff">I thought you were dead!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

450
00:39:20,200 --> 00:39:21,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm stuffed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

451
00:39:22,320 --> 00:39:23,800
<font color="#ffffff">Are you going to tell me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

452
00:39:24,560 --> 00:39:25,920
<font color="#ffffff">where you've been?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

453
00:39:27,480 --> 00:39:28,600
<font color="#ffffff">Dad,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

454
00:39:28,680 --> 00:39:33,440
<font color="#ffffff">I think you should ask</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">how I even survived instead.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

455
00:39:43,640 --> 00:39:45,880
<font color="#ffffff">How is Chansuek acting?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

456
00:39:48,280 --> 00:39:49,360
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

457
00:39:57,360 --> 00:39:58,360
<font color="#ffffff">Just speak freely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

458
00:39:58,920 --> 00:40:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">Paul can handle it,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

459
00:40:00,960 --> 00:40:01,840
<font color="#ffffff">right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

460
00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:04,800
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

461
00:40:07,480 --> 00:40:10,240
<font color="#ffffff">Chan still doesn't quite trust me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

462
00:40:10,320 --> 00:40:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">Probably because</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">he still can't remember much.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

463
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:15,640
<font color="#ffffff">What about Luang Pho Suea?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

464
00:40:15,720 --> 00:40:17,880
<font color="#ffffff">Has Chan started to doubt him at all?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

465
00:40:18,880 --> 00:40:20,280
<font color="#ffffff">From what I see,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

466
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:25,000
<font color="#ffffff">even though Chan is starting to feel</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">slightly uneasy around Luang Pho,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

467
00:40:25,080 --> 00:40:27,120
<font color="#ffffff">he still trusts him implicitly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

468
00:40:29,000 --> 00:40:30,280
<font color="#ffffff">I think</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

469
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:33,200
<font color="#ffffff">it's because Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">saved his life,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

470
00:40:34,240 --> 00:40:36,120
<font color="#ffffff">so Chan feels like he owes him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

471
00:40:38,440 --> 00:40:39,480
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

472
00:40:40,400 --> 00:40:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">At his core,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

473
00:40:42,360 --> 00:40:44,240
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek is a deeply grateful person.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

474
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:46,880
<font color="#ffffff">It will be hard to break that trust.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

475
00:40:48,080 --> 00:40:49,560
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry, boss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

476
00:40:50,440 --> 00:40:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">Because starting tomorrow,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

477
00:40:52,080 --> 00:40:54,160
<font color="#ffffff">no matter how grateful Chansuek is,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

478
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:58,400
<font color="#ffffff">he will never trust Luang Pho again</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">just as we plan.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

479
00:40:59,480 --> 00:41:01,120
<font color="#ffffff">I hope it's not all talk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

480
00:41:03,160 --> 00:41:05,080
<font color="#ffffff">I have everything prepared perfectly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

481
00:41:05,160 --> 00:41:06,760
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry. Right, Wayu?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

482
00:41:07,720 --> 00:41:09,000
<font color="#ffffff">Everything is ready, boss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

483
00:41:11,680 --> 00:41:12,800
<font color="#ffffff">Good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

484
00:41:55,120 --> 00:41:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">I almost got flattened!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

485
00:42:00,920 --> 00:42:02,800
<font color="#ffffff">What's up, Boonrod?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

486
00:42:02,880 --> 00:42:04,160
<font color="#ffffff">What's going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

487
00:42:04,680 --> 00:42:06,040
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

488
00:42:06,960 --> 00:42:07,960
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

489
00:42:10,800 --> 00:42:12,040
<font color="#ffffff">Yes?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

490
00:42:13,320 --> 00:42:14,840
<font color="#ffffff">So…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

491
00:42:15,640 --> 00:42:16,480
<font color="#ffffff">I…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

492
00:42:19,360 --> 00:42:20,600
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

493
00:42:24,840 --> 00:42:26,040
<font color="#ffffff">I just…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

494
00:42:31,640 --> 00:42:32,680
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

495
00:42:33,600 --> 00:42:35,400
<font color="#ffffff">have we met before?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

496
00:42:45,520 --> 00:42:46,800
<font color="#ffffff">Did your memory come back?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

497
00:42:49,360 --> 00:42:50,280
<font color="#ffffff">No.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

498
00:42:51,600 --> 00:42:52,480
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

499
00:42:53,080 --> 00:42:54,200
<font color="#ffffff">No?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

500
00:42:54,280 --> 00:42:56,920
<font color="#ffffff">Then why are you asking me this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

501
00:43:01,080 --> 00:43:01,920
<font color="#ffffff">I…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

502
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:04,560
<font color="#ffffff">Did someone tell you something?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

503
00:43:05,560 --> 00:43:07,240
<font color="#ffffff">No one.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

504
00:43:07,320 --> 00:43:08,560
<font color="#ffffff">No one at all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

505
00:43:12,400 --> 00:43:13,720
<font color="#ffffff">Then what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

506
00:43:16,600 --> 00:43:20,080
<font color="#ffffff">You're interrogating me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

507
00:43:20,160 --> 00:43:22,120
<font color="#ffffff">like a cop interrogating a suspect.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

508
00:43:22,720 --> 00:43:24,480
<font color="#ffffff">So, are you going to tell me or not?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

509
00:43:24,560 --> 00:43:27,960
<font color="#ffffff">-If not, I'm going to sleep.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-I will! I'll tell you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

510
00:43:29,200 --> 00:43:30,080
<font color="#ffffff">Well,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

511
00:43:30,160 --> 00:43:32,080
<font color="#ffffff">I feel like</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

512
00:43:32,160 --> 00:43:34,080
<font color="#ffffff">you know my true identity very well.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

513
00:43:34,160 --> 00:43:35,360
<font color="#ffffff">I mean,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

514
00:43:36,280 --> 00:43:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">who I used to be</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

515
00:43:38,720 --> 00:43:40,000
<font color="#ffffff">back when I was Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

516
00:43:48,240 --> 00:43:50,280
<font color="#ffffff">Where did you get that money?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

517
00:43:51,080 --> 00:43:52,600
<font color="#ffffff">I already told you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

518
00:43:53,240 --> 00:43:55,120
<font color="#ffffff">I know nothing about it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

519
00:43:55,840 --> 00:43:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">I was framed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

520
00:43:59,880 --> 00:44:02,760
<font color="#ffffff">I've done good for nearly 40 years.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

521
00:44:04,120 --> 00:44:05,360
<font color="#ffffff">But if what I've done</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

522
00:44:05,440 --> 00:44:07,640
<font color="#ffffff">isn't enough to clear my name</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in everyone's eyes,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

523
00:44:08,600 --> 00:44:09,920
<font color="#ffffff">then go ahead.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

524
00:44:10,000 --> 00:44:13,200
<font color="#ffffff">Punish me however you like.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

525
00:44:20,440 --> 00:44:21,400
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

526
00:44:23,960 --> 00:44:26,480
<font color="#ffffff">I knew you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

527
00:44:27,240 --> 00:44:29,520
<font color="#ffffff">back when you were Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

528
00:44:32,600 --> 00:44:34,440
<font color="#ffffff"><i>It's exactly what Deputy Papon said.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

